{"path":"biology/genetics/mendel/gene-location","title":"基因定位实验（正反交判断）","type":"example","html":"<p>已知某昆虫的一对相对性状由一对等位基因控制，现有纯合突变型与纯合野生型个体（雌雄均有）。为判断该基因位于常染色体还是 X 染色体上，最合适的实验方案是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 用突变型雄性与突变型雌性杂交</p>\n<p>B. 分别进行正反交（♂突变×♀野生 与 ♂野生×♀突变），比较子代表现型</p>\n<p>C. 用野生型雌雄个体杂交</p>\n<p>D. 任意正交一次即可判断</p>\n<ul>\n<li>伴性遗传（X 染色体）的判断证据链（选填背住）：\n<ol>\n<li>正反交结果不同；</li>\n<li>女患→父必患、子必患（伴 X 隐性交叉遗传）；</li>\n<li>遗传与性别相关（性别比例异常）；</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>变式：若题目已知是隐性性状、判断基因在常染色体还是 X 染色体 → 选<strong>隐性雌 × 显性雄</strong>（&quot;隐雌×显雄&quot;）：子代雌性全为显性、雄性全为隐性 → 伴 X 遗传；子代表现与性别无关 → 常染色体遗传；</li>\n<li>若正反交结果<strong>只与母本有关</strong>（子代全随母方）→ 细胞质遗传（叶绿体/线粒体基因），与伴 X 区分开（伴 X 不&quot;仅随母方&quot;）；</li>\n<li>大题书写：&quot;选择正反交组合，若两组子代表现型一致则为常染色体遗传，不一致则为伴 X 遗传&quot;——结论要写&quot;若…则…&quot;的完整判断。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>正反交判断法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若基因位于<strong>常染色体</strong>：正反交基因型组合相同（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AA\\times aa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">aa\\times AA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aa</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">AA</span></span></span></span> 等价），后代表现型及比例<strong>一致</strong>；</li>\n<li>若基因位于<strong>X 染色体</strong>：正反交组合不同（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X^AX^A\\times X^aY</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9247em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi>A</mi></msup><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X^aX^a\\times X^AY</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07847em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span>），后代表现型<strong>不一致</strong>（交叉遗传：雌雄表现差异）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以做<strong>正反交</strong>并比较子代：结果相同 → 常染色体；结果不同 → 伴 X（再结合交叉遗传特征确认）。选 <strong>B</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：判断常染色体 vs 伴 X → <strong>口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;判断伴性，正反交见分晓&quot;</strong>：正反交结果相同 → 常染色体；不同 → X 染色体。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>A、C：同一性别组合杂交，看不出性别关联 ✘；</li>\n<li>D：只做一次正交，没有对照 ✘；</li>\n<li>B：正反交互为对照，一眼定乾坤 ✓。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>30 秒锁定 B</strong>——设计实验题先想&quot;<strong>对照组</strong>&quot;在哪。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"已知某昆虫的一对相对性状由一对等位基因控制，现有纯合突变型与纯合野生型个体（雌雄均有）。为判断该基因位于常染色体还是 X 染色体上，最合适的实验方案是（ ） A. 用突变型雄性与突变型雌性杂交 B. 分别进行正反交（♂突变×♀野生 与 ♂野","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"较难","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"正反交结果不同只说明\"与性别相关\"（伴性或细胞质遗传）；要排除细胞质遗传还需确认\"母本决定\"特征；判断伴 X 还需父→女、母→男等交叉遗传特征。","fit":["判断基因位于常染色体还是 X 染色体","正反交实验设计","选填题"],"updated":"Mon Feb 17 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传与进化"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律"},{"slug":"gene-location","title":"基因定位实验（正反交判断）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"epistasis-12-3-1","title":"显性上位 12:3:1（9+3 合并）","type":"example"},{"slug":"epistasis-homozygous","title":"上位效应中的纯合比例（单显 1/3）","type":"example"},{"slug":"experiment-design-multiple","title":"显隐性判断测交（全黑 vs 出现白）","type":"example"},{"slug":"genetic-9331","title":"9331 变式比例（拆分法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"lethal-ratio","title":"显性纯合致死比例（筛除 1/4）","type":"example"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"multi-gene-types","title":"遗传多对基因·比值变式全表与题眼","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"two-disease-prob","title":"常染色体+伴X 两病概率（拆分相乘）","type":"example"},{"slug":"two-gene-ratio","title":"两对基因概率（拆分法）","type":"example"}]}